# Environment Variables

# ── Google OAuth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google sign-in for this app is handled by the Base44 platform, which performs
# the redirect to accounts.google.com on our behalf. Which Google project the
# user sees on the consent screen ("continue to …") is therefore decided by the
# OAuth client configured in the Base44 dashboard under
#   Dashboard → Settings → Authentication → Google → "Use a custom OAuth from
#   Google Console"
# NOT by anything in this repo.
#
# This file previously pinned
#   VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=342662050420-hjsrds4v122ggc6np9hlcgp0n2dt5rqd…
# which is *Base44's own platform client*, not ours — it is the client id the
# platform redirect already uses, and its redirect_uri is
# https://app.base44.com/api/apps/auth/callback. A Google Cloud project cannot
# be configured against it (we don't own it), and shipping it here invited
# exactly that mistake, so it has been removed.
#
# Set this ONLY if an in-app Google Identity Services flow is added using a
# client id from a Google Cloud project we control (see
# src/components/GoogleLoginButton.jsx). Leave it unset otherwise.
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-own-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
